[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1263.59, "timestamp": "00:21:03", "text": "当时我的游戏电脑正好派上了用场。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1267.35, "timestamp": "00:21:07", "text": "但是我的电脑在线支持，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1271.029, "timestamp": "00:21:11", "text": "一种方法是同时利用CPU和GPU。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1285.19, "timestamp": "00:21:25", "text": "是啊，那一点都不好玩。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1287.83, "timestamp": "00:21:27", "text": "男人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1291.99, "timestamp": "00:21:31", "text": "是啊，我依然很想念"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1293.59, "timestamp": "00:21:33", "text": "不，你说得对。对不起。你走了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1295.83, "timestamp": "00:21:35", "text": "我的错。对不起。是的。你失踪了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1299.27, "timestamp": "00:21:39", "text": "不，确实如此。不，不。嗯，我也这么认为。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1300.71, "timestamp": "00:21:40", "text": "说实话，我的情况也一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1303.83, "timestamp": "00:21:43", "text": "呃，我的电脑显卡坏了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1305.669, "timestamp": "00:21:45", "text": "嗯，就是在同一台电脑上，我玩过……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1308.549, "timestamp": "00:21:48", "text": "很久以前的洪水。"}]